From 73923f92a7b8e323d74a47b2d32cd185ff1214ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seuj09 <jeus110310@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:12:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: supply: sc27xx-fg: allow power-supplies

The binding pulls in power-supply.yaml but is additionalProperties: false, so
the power-supplies property that power-supply.yaml defines is not accepted on
the fuel gauge node. The power supply core reads it from the node to find the
charger that supplies the battery, which is how sc27xx_fuel_gauge learns the
charging status from a charger other than the SC27xx one (the Infinix X6525
uses a bq24158). List it as bq27xxx.yaml and cpcap-battery.yaml do.

Signed-off-by: Seuj09 <jeus110310@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
index c1de2c802..6ec99f379 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
@@ -57,6 +57,8 @@ properties:
 
   monitored-battery: true
 
+  power-supplies: true
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
-- 
2.43.0

